  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ndumberi Milk Processing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Dairy.Location: Kiambu County.Summary: The project will strengthen Ndumberi&apos;s capacity to jointly market milk and yogurt products, thus increasing revenues of the cooperative and incomes of individual dairy farmers. Grant activities include purchasing milk and yogurt processing equipment, providing training and an exchange visit to farmers, and developing branding for Ndumberi&apos;s products.</narrative>
  </description>
